Package: SEAtraits
Title: An R interface to the trait database of South East Asian flora
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Author: Hao Ran Lai [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Hao Ran Lai <hrlai.ecology@gmail.com>
Authors@R: person(given = "Hao Ran", family = "Lai",
    email = "hrlai.ecology@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: SEAtraits is an R interface to multiple trait databases in the
    South East Asia region. It is currently a minimal API based on the
    austraits package.
